#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:3
#: 491a26a60f3c476e9c1ca95397e066fe
msgid "Testing new releases and updates"
msgstr "測試新發行版與更新"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:7
#: 671b7c60a4824f308de7a943ef45008d
msgid "This page is intended for advanced users."
msgstr "此頁面適用於進階使用者。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:9
#: e7d172e5f6bd4a27a335923b3f648a5d
msgid ""
"Testing new Qubes OS releases and updates is one of the most helpful ways in "
"which you can :doc:`contribute </introduction/contributing>` to the Qubes OS "
"Project. If you’re interested in helping with this, please `join the testing "
"team <https://forum.qubes-os.org/t/joining-the-testing-team/5190>`__. There "
"are several different types of testing, which we’ll cover below."
msgstr ""
"測試新的 Qubes OS 發行版與更新是您向 Qubes OS 專案\\ :doc:`貢獻 </"
"introduction/contributing>`\\ 最有幫助的方式之一。如果您有興趣協助，請\\ `加"
"入測試團隊 <https://forum.qubes-os.org/t/joining-the-testing-"
"team/5190>`__\\ 。以下我們將介紹幾種不同類型的測試。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:11
#: 92136d14a85746f1a47dc3cd4551a547
msgid ""
"**Warning:** Software testing is intended for advanced users and developers. "
"You should only attempt to do this if you know what you’re doing. Never rely "
"on code that is in testing for critical work!"
msgstr ""
"**警告：** 軟體測試適用於進階使用者和開發人員。只有當您知道自己在做什麼時才應"
"嘗試。切勿在關鍵工作中依賴處於測試階段的程式碼！"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:14
#: 1f4cb3719bce4cb48dca05f7134db20f
msgid "Releases"
msgstr "發行版"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:17
#: 47cf8ef6af65414f9385676489b10772
msgid "How to test upcoming Qubes OS releases:"
msgstr "如何測試即將推出的 Qubes OS 發行版："

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:19
#: e54234682f964f928556529edd403a05
msgid ""
"Test the latest release candidate (RC) on the `downloads <https://www.qubes-"
"os.org/downloads/>`__ page, if one is currently available. (Or try an older "
"RC from our `FTP server <https://ftp.qubes-os.org/iso/>`__.)"
msgstr ""
"測試`下載頁面 <https://www.qubes-os.org/downloads/>`__ 上最新的發行候選版"
"（RC）（如果目前有的話）。（或從我們的 `FTP 伺服器 <https://ftp.qubes-os.org/"
"iso/>`__\\ 嘗試較舊的 RC。）"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:21
#: fa9e53e495f74d16ab18eabcf08c943e
msgid ""
"Try the `signed weekly builds <https://qubes.notset.fr/iso/>`__. (`Learn "
"more <https://forum.qubes-os.org/t/16929>`__ and `track their status "
"<https://github.com/fepitre/updates-status-iso/issues>`__.)"
msgstr ""
"嘗試\\ `經過簽署的每週建置 <https://qubes.notset.fr/iso/>`__\\ 。（\\ `了解更"
"多 <https://forum.qubes-os.org/t/16929>`__\\ 並\\ `追蹤其狀態 <https://"
"github.com/fepitre/updates-status-iso/issues>`__\\ 。）"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:23
#: 07eb3e3f75ac473ab06f1907f73c68b9
msgid ""
"Use :doc:`qubes-builder </developer/building/qubes-builder-v2>` to build the "
"latest release yourself."
msgstr ""
"使用 :doc:`qubes-builder </developer/building/qubes-builder-v2>` 自行建置最新"
"的發行版。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:25
#: 76744a76ea9c4dc8851082bd189aa9cf
msgid ""
"(No support) Experiment with developer alpha ISOs found from time to time at "
"`Qubes OpenQA <https://openqa.qubes-os.org/>`__."
msgstr ""
"（無支援）偶爾在 `Qubes OpenQA <https://openqa.qubes-os.org/>`__ 上嘗試開發"
"者 alpha ISO。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:29
#: e0202d0508704c2c8c31c9bea5e6a010
msgid ""
"Please make sure to :doc:`report any bugs you encounter </introduction/issue-"
"tracking>`."
msgstr "請務必 :doc:`回報您遇到的任何錯誤 </introduction/issue-tracking>`。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:31
#: b171ecef58b64e7c9a2c5212d997e071
msgid ""
"See :doc:`Version scheme </developer/releases/version-scheme>` for details "
"about release versions and schedules. See :doc:`Release checklist </"
"developer/releases/todo>` for details about the RC process."
msgstr ""
"請參閱 :doc:`版本方案 </developer/releases/version-scheme>` 以了解發行版本與"
"時程的詳細資訊。請參閱\\ :doc:`版本檢查清單 </developer/releases/todo>`\\ 以"
"了解 RC 過程的詳細資訊。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:34
#: 004b0a3a174c434b934bce4413b12f3a
msgid "Updates"
msgstr "更新"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:37
#: 6b4e7a1d5e8c4d5fb064d98e684daba3
msgid "How to test updates:"
msgstr "如何測試更新："

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:39
#: 8e9de64346c84197a14b583d14c25edb
msgid ""
"Enable :ref:`dom0 testing repositories <user/advanced-topics/how-to-install-"
"software-in-dom0:testing repositories>`."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :ref:`dom0 測試儲存庫 <user/advanced-topics/how-to-install-software-in-"
"dom0:testing repositories>`。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:41
#: 14346de55c9346e1ae79ed05314e4564
msgid ""
"Enable :ref:`template testing repositories <user/how-to-guides/how-to-"
"install-software:testing repositories>`."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :ref:`模板測試儲存庫 <user/how-to-guides/how-to-install-software:"
"testing repositories>`。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:45
#: f20cc8723afe474191490ceecc98e990
msgid ""
"Every new update is first uploaded to the ``security-testing`` repository if "
"it is a security update or ``current-testing`` if it is a normal update. The "
"update remains in ``security-testing`` or ``current-testing`` for a minimum "
"of one week. On occasion, an exception is made for a particularly critical "
"security update, which is immediately pushed to the ``current`` stable "
"repository. In general, however, security updates remain in ``security-"
"testing`` for two weeks before migrating to ``current``. Normal updates "
"generally remain in ``current-testing`` until they have been sufficiently "
"tested by the community, which can last weeks or even months, depending on "
"the amount of feedback received (see :ref:`user/downloading-installing-"
"upgrading/testing:providing feedback`)."
msgstr ""
"每個新更新首先會上傳到 ``security-testing`` 儲存庫（如果是安全性更新）或 "
"``current-testing``（如果是一般更新）。該更新會在 ``security-testing`` 或 "
"``current-testing`` 中保留至少一週。有時，對於特別關鍵的安全性更新會有例外，"
"會立即推送至 ``current`` 穩定儲存庫。但一般來說，安全性更新會在 ``security-"
"testing`` 中保留兩週，然後才遷移至 ``current``。一般更新通常會留在 ``current-"
"testing`` 中，直到社群充分測試為止，這可能持續數週甚至數月，具體取決於收到的"
"回饋數量（請參閱 :ref:`user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing:"
"providing feedback`）。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:47
#: 53fb93511e5b4fe094f23a9145e6b221
msgid ""
"“Sufficient testing” is, in practice, a fluid term that is up the "
"developers’ judgment. In general, it means either that no negative feedback "
"and at least one piece of positive feedback has been received or that the "
"package has been in ``current-testing`` for long enough, depending on the "
"component and the complexity of the changes."
msgstr ""
"「充分測試」在實務上是一個靈活的術語，取決於開發人員的判斷。一般來說，它表示"
"要麼沒有收到負面回饋且至少收到一條正面回饋，要麼該套件在 ``current-testing`` "
"中的時間已經足夠長——具體取決於元件和變更的複雜度。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:49
#: 39c072d403d147638b21006d395a527b
msgid ""
"A limitation of the current testing setup is that it is only possible to "
"migrate the *most recent version* of a package from ``current-testing`` to "
"``current``. This means that, if a newer version of a package is uploaded to "
"``current-testing``, it will no longer be possible to migrate any older "
"versions of that same package from ``current-testing`` to ``current``, even "
"if one of those older versions has been deemed stable enough. While this "
"limitation can be inconvenient, the benefits outweigh the costs, since it "
"greatly simplifies the testing and reporting process."
msgstr ""
"目前測試設定的一個限制是，只能將套件的\\ *最新版本*\\ 從 ``current-testing`` "
"遷移至 ``current``。這意味著，如果某個套件的較新版本上傳到 ``current-"
"testing``，則無法再將同一套件的任何較舊版本從 ``current-testing`` 遷移至 "
"``current``，即使其中某個較舊版本已被認為足夠穩定。雖然這個限制可能帶來不便，"
"但其好處大於成本，因為它大大簡化了測試和回報流程。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:52
#: 849512d6b1f144c3b3974bec744eb890
msgid "Templates"
msgstr "模板"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:55
#: 0c5018ec2b5f4d618cc691891877140e
msgid "How to test :doc:`templates </user/templates/templates>`:"
