#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:63
#: f126e715588b4a0393303e8570fe13f8
msgid ""
"To temporarily enable any of these repos, use the ``--enablerepo=<repo-"
"name>`` option. Example commands:"
msgstr ""
"若要暫時啟用任何這些儲存庫，請使用 ``--enablerepo=<儲存庫名稱>`` 選項。範例命"
"令："

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:72
#: 18a8d7f65fad482fb5fbeaaadfb391c5
msgid ""
"To enable any of these repos permanently, change the corresponding "
"``enabled`` value to ``1`` in ``/etc/qubes/repo-templates``. To disable any "
"of these repos permanently, change the corresponding ``enabled`` value to "
"``0``."
msgstr ""
"若要永久啟用任何這些儲存庫，請在 ``/etc/qubes/repo-templates`` 中將對應的 "
"``enabled`` 值變更為 ``1``。若要永久停用任何這些儲存庫，請將對應的 "
"``enabled`` 值變更為 ``0``。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:75
#: a87c822036ac45ea859f7b98e3dee790
msgid "Providing feedback"
msgstr "提供回饋"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:78
#: 2ca9397d756e45f48f5faa4c96a1c736
msgid ""
"Since the whole point of testing software is to discover and fix bugs, your "
"feedback is an essential part of this process. We use an `automated build "
"process <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-infrastructure/blob/master/README."
"md>`__. For every package that is uploaded to a testing repository, a GitHub "
"issue is created in the `updates-status <https://github.com/QubesOS/updates-"
"status/issues>`__ repository for tracking purposes. We welcome any kind of "
"feedback on any package in any testing repository. Even a simple |thumbsup| "
"“thumbs up” or |thumbsdown| “thumbs down” reaction on the package’s "
"associated issue would help us to decide whether the package is ready to be "
"migrated to a stable repository. If you :doc:`report a bug </introduction/"
"issue-tracking>` in a package that is in a testing repository, please "
"reference the appropriate issue in `updates-status <https://github.com/"
"QubesOS/updates-status/issues>`__."
msgstr ""
"既然測試軟體的重點在於發現和修復錯誤，您的回饋是此過程中至關重要的一部分。我"
"們使用\\ `自動化建置流程 <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-infrastructure/"
"blob/master/README.md>`__\\ 。對於上傳到測試儲存庫的每個套件，都會在 "
"`updates-status <https://github.com/QubesOS/updates-status/issues>`__ 儲存庫"
"中建立一個 GitHub issue 以進行追蹤。我們歡迎對任何測試儲存庫中任何套件的任何"
"類型回饋。即使是在該套件的相關 issue 上的一個簡單 |thumbsup| 「讚」或 |"
"thumbsdown| 「倒讚」反應，都能幫助我們判斷該套件是否已準備好遷移至穩定儲存"
"庫。如果您在測試儲存庫中的套件上\\ :doc:`回報錯誤 </introduction/issue-"
"tracking>`\\ ，請在 `updates-status <https://github.com/QubesOS/updates-"
"status/issues>`__ 中引用相應的 issue。"

